// Wall A r6 — struct-literal field-init mismatch. The LAST scope-wireable
// rung. The same `struct Point { x: i32, y: i32 }` registry r5 builds also
// types a CONSTRUCTION site `Point{ x: <expr>, y: <expr> }`: each field-init
// value is matched to the declared field type and a known-scalar mismatch is
// REJECTed with HX3011 (Rust E0308 check_expr_struct_fields coercion). Two
// REJECT shapes + one matching control:
//   struct Point { x: i32, y: i32 }
//   fn f() {
