    // (v) static-types r9d — struct-literal field-EXISTENCE reject + F4
    // warn-first SEVERITY two-step. Flag-ON (HEXA_STATIC_TYPES=1, no ARRAY_
    // LOWER dependency): exactly 1 HX3016 — `Q{ x: 1, z: 2 }` where `z` is not
    // a field of the KNOWN struct Q (the r9d existence arm); the subset init
    // `Q{ y: 3 }` and the registry-unknown `Nope{ w: 1 }` stay clean, and 0
    // HX3011 proves no type-mismatch cross-fire. The COUNT is band-invariant;
    // the F4 axis is SEVERITY: plain HEXA_STATIC_TYPES=1 → the HX3016 lands in
    // the WARNING band (rc=0, non-fatal — the build still compiles), while
    // HEXA_STATIC_TYPES_STRICT=1 re-escalates it to the ERROR band (rc≠0,
