    }

    // (x) static-types F0 flag-fold — array-lower now folds under the single
    // HEXA_STATIC_TYPES flag (wall_a_endgame.md §B.3 F0). Re-uses the r9b
    // return-element module: PRE-fold this REJECT required BOTH HEXA_STATIC
    // _TYPES=1 AND HEXA_STATIC_TYPES_ARRAY_LOWER=1; POST-fold HEXA_STATIC_TYPES
    // =1 ALONE lowers `[i64]` structurally so `fn f() -> [i64] { return [1.5]
    // }` rejects at the default-ON HX3004 site (1 HX3004), with `fn g() ->
