    }

    // (y) static-types F4 warn-first — HX3011 SEVERITY two-step. Re-uses the
    // r1 let-mismatch module (`let x: i32 = "s"` → 1 HX3011). The COUNT is
    // band-invariant (case (h) already pins it); the F4 axis is SEVERITY:
    // plain HEXA_STATIC_TYPES=1 → the HX3011 lands in the WARNING band (rc=0,
    // non-fatal, the shipping path survives a latent true-positive), while
    // HEXA_STATIC_TYPES_STRICT=1 re-escalates it to the ERROR band (rc≠0,
    // REJECT — the fatal path stays reachable so no coverage is lost). Default
